# Health Analyzer Condition Diagnostics (en-US)
condition-brain-tumor = Degenerative Brain Tumor
condition-brain-tumor-desc = Active neoplasm in cerebral lobe; requires Mannitol treatment or neurosurgery.

condition-blood-deficiency = Blood Deficiency / Anemia
condition-blood-deficiency-desc = Impaired erythrocyte production; requires blood transfusions or iron supplements.

condition-bad-back = Chronic Dorsalgia (Bad Back)
condition-bad-back-desc = Severe spinal degradation; unable to carry heavy storage on back.

condition-glass-jaw = Fragile Jaw (Glass Jaw)
condition-glass-jaw-desc = Highly vulnerable to cranial trauma; susceptible to impact knockouts.

condition-frail = Cellular / Bone Fragility
condition-frail-desc = Reduced tissue density; suffers 30% increased physical damage and severe wounding.

condition-claustrophobia = Severe Claustrophobia
condition-claustrophobia-desc = Acute confinement panic disorder; risk of psychogenic hyperventilation.

condition-social-anxiety = Acute Social Anxiety
condition-social-anxiety-desc = Elevated autonomic stress response when surrounded by crowds.

condition-heavy-sleeper = Hypersomnia (Heavy Sleeper)
condition-heavy-sleeper-desc = Severe difficulty awakening from sleep or sedation.

condition-reality-dissociation = Reality Dissociation Syndrome
condition-reality-dissociation-desc = Psychiatric sensory disorder presenting recurrent auditory and visual delusions.

condition-pacifist = Violence Aversion (Pacifism)
condition-pacifist-desc = Psychological inhibition preventing intentional harm against living beings.

condition-bad-touch = Haphephobia (Aversion to Touch)
condition-bad-touch-desc = Severe distress and repulsion upon receiving physical contact.

condition-nyctophobia = Acute Nyctophobia
condition-nyctophobia-desc = Panic triggered by darkness; disorientation and tremors in unlit areas.

condition-smoker = Nicotine Dependence (Smoking Addiction)
condition-smoker-desc = Chemical addiction to nicotine alkaloids; experiences withdrawal distress.

condition-illiterate = Functional Illiteracy
condition-illiterate-desc = Cognitive inability to comprehend written text or complex electronic interfaces.

condition-depression = Major Depressive Disorder
condition-depression-desc = Recurrent episodes of asthenia, heavy sighing, and reduced physical stamina.

condition-family-heirloom = Obsessive Heirloom Attachment
condition-family-heirloom-desc = Extreme psychological attachment to a family heirloom; panic when separated.

condition-cursed = Statistical Misfortune Anomaly
condition-cursed-desc = Atypical prevalence of clumsiness, stumbles, and recurring physical mishaps.

condition-poor-aim = Impaired Oculomotor Hand-Eye Coordination
condition-poor-aim-desc = Severe ballistic trajectory deviation when firing projectile weapons.

condition-soft-spoken = Hypokinetic Phonation (Soft-Spoken)
condition-soft-spoken-desc = Pathologically reduced vocal volume; whispers almost exclusively.

condition-big-hands = Digital Hypertrophy (Chunky Fingers)
condition-big-hands-desc = Thickened phalanges; severe difficulty operating small firearms or tools.

condition-pushover = Defensive Muscular Hypotonia (Pushover)
condition-pushover-desc = Inability to resist grapples, shoving, or forceful takedowns.

condition-blindness = Permanent Total Blindness
condition-blindness-desc = Complete, irreversible loss of bilateral ocular vision.

condition-narcolepsy = Narcolepsy
condition-narcolepsy-desc = Uncontrolled sudden sleep episodes during active wakefulness.

condition-monochromacy = Achromatopsia (Monochromacy)
condition-monochromacy-desc = Total absence of color cone receptors; perceives solely in grayscale.

condition-paracusia = Paracusia
condition-paracusia-desc = Spontaneous phantom auditory hallucinations of unverified origin.
